cloud-architecture-diagram
// Fingerprint: how one scan works.
// Open in VS Code with the Eraser extension, then use Export → Export to SVG and save as docs/architecture.svg

colorMode pastel
styleMode shadow
typeface clean
direction right

User [icon: user, color: "#F26B57"]

Web app [icon: smartphone, color: "#F26B57"] {
  Level picker [icon: sliders]
  Live scan view [icon: activity]
  Report [icon: bar-chart-2]
}

FastAPI service [icon: server, color: "#3E8EDE"] {
  Guardrails [icon: shield, color: "#E5484D"]
  Session store [icon: clock]
  Progress stream [icon: radio]
}

Scan pipeline [icon: cpu, color: "#8C7AE6"] {
  Plan queries [icon: list]
  Match to you [icon: user-check]
  Extract details [icon: filter]
  Score and fixes [icon: award]
}

TinyFish [icon: globe, color: "#F4A93B"] {
  Search API [icon: search]
  Fetch API [icon: file-text]
  Agent API [icon: zap]
}

Free public checks [icon: unlock, color: "#5DCAA0"] {
  XposedOrNot breaches [icon: alert-triangle]
  Gravatar [icon: image]
  Username probes [icon: at-sign]
}

Config YAML [icon: settings, color: "#66B032"]

User > Level picker: name + chosen details
Level picker > Guardrails: start scan with consent
Guardrails > Plan queries: rate limit, level scope
Plan queries > Search API: 9 to 24 searches, free
Search API > Match to you: titles, snippets, URLs
Match to you > Fetch API: top 20 pages, free
Fetch API > Extract details: page text
Fetch API --> Agent API: blocked people-finder only, opt-in, paid
Agent API --> Extract details: structured JSON
Plan queries > XposedOrNot breaches, Gravatar, Username probes: Standard and Deep only
XposedOrNot breaches > Score and fixes
Gravatar > Score and fixes
Username probes > Score and fixes
Extract details > Score and fixes: masked values + evidence
Score and fixes > Session store: in memory, 30 min TTL
Session store > Progress stream
Progress stream > Live scan view: live events
Session store > Report: findings, score, fixes
Report > Session store: is this you, yes or not me
Config YAML --> Plan queries
Config YAML --> Score and fixes
